# Flux source-controller exclusions (gitignore-style, evaluated from repo root).
# See https://fluxcd.io/flux/components/source/gitrepositories/#excluding-files

# Bare Helm values snippet (no apiVersion/kind/metadata) accidentally committed
# alongside the real HelmRelease manifests in commit 3ec109d (2026-09-07). The
# flux-system Kustomization tries to apply every YAML file under
# infrastructure/cluster/flux/ as a Kubernetes resource, so this one file broke
# reconciliation for the whole tree from that commit onward ("failed to decode
# Kubernetes YAML ... missing Resource metadata"). The actual live source of
# truth for jhub is infrastructure/cluster/flux/jhub/jhub-release.yaml
# (spec.values, inline) -- this file is a stray, drifted copy kept only for
# local reference, never consumed by Flux.
/infrastructure/cluster/flux/jhub/jhub-values.yaml
